The Fixer was a demonic figure who stepped through the fountain of blood in the hall of [[Geography/The Quorum|the Quorum]] on the [[Geography/Star 221,325|Joker World at Star 221,325]], while the Scale delvers fought [[Sigzil Haight]]'s servants.

[[Org/The Scale/People/Manuel de la Cruzada|Reverend Warden Manuel de la Cruzada]] knew him by the name.

He was killed the next time the delvers met him, in the hall of the Quorum. Four of the delvers struck him in turn as he stepped out of the blood, and he was cut down before he could finish what he had come to do.
